## @file                                                                       # [CODE_FIRST] 13357
#  RedfishResourceDxe installs EDKII_REDFISH_RESOURCE_PROTOCOL.                # [CODE_FIRST] 13357
#                                                                              # [CODE_FIRST] 13357
